  ],
  "summary": "Run get/put on a least-frequently-used cache.",
  "statement": "Simulate a cache holding at most `capacity` keys. Each operation in `ops` is `\"put K V\"` or `\"get K\"`. Each\nkey has a use count: `get` of a present key and every `put` add one use. When a put of a new key would exceed\ncapacity, first evict the key with the fewest uses; ties go to the least recently used. Return the results of\nall `get` operations (`-1` for a missing key).",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= capacity <= 10^4",
    "1 <= ops.length <= 2 * 10^5"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "input": "capacity = 2, ops = [\"put 1 1\", \"put 2 2\", \"get 1\", \"put 3 3\", \"get 2\", \"get 3\", \"put 4 4\", \"get 1\", \"get 3\", \"get 4\"]",
      "output": "[1, -1, 3, -1, 3, 4]"
    },
    {
      "input": "capacity = 1, ops = [\"put 1 1\", \"get 1\", \"put 2 2\", \"get 1\", \"get 2\"]",
      "output": "[1, -1, 2]"
    },
    {
      "input": "capacity = 2, ops = [\"put 1 1\", \"put 1 7\", \"put 2 2\", \"put 3 3\", \"get 1\", \"get 2\", \"get 3\"]",
      "output": "[7, -1, 3]"
    }
  ],
  "signature": {
    "method": "lfuCache",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "capacity",
        "type": "int"
      },
      {
        "name": "ops",
        "type": "String[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int[]"
  },
  "starter_code": "class Solution {\n    public int[] lfuCache(int capacity, String[] ops) {\n        // TODO: write your solution here\n        return new int[0];\n    }\n}\n",
  "hints": [
    "You need to find the smallest use count quickly and, within it, the oldest key.",
    "Map key \u2192 (value, count), map count \u2192 insertion-ordered set of keys, and track the current minimum count.",
    "on access: move key from bucket[count] to bucket[count+1]; if bucket[minCount] empties, minCount += 1\non put of a new key at capacity: evict the first key of bucket[minCount]; then insert with count 1, minCount = 1",
    "Every operation is O(1). A new key always resets the minimum count to 1."
  ],
  "expected_complexity": {
    "time": "O(1) per op",
    "space": "O(capacity)"
  },
